cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Biological detail does not guarantee portability of colorectal cancer metagenomic classifiers"
abstract: >-
  Prospective portability stress test across ten colorectal-cancer development
  cohorts and an untouched 200-sample external cohort, comparing taxonomic,
  functional, gene-family, mechanistic, correction, and label-free risk signals.
